      ":question/problem": "Consider the triangle $C$ in the plane with vertices $(0,0),(2,0)$ and $(0,2),$ and the region $D$ bounded by $C.$ According to Green's theorem, \n\n$$\n{\u222e}_{C}{x}^{2}{y}^{2}\\,dx+({x}^{3}y+\\operatorname{sin}\u2061y)\\,dy={\u222c}_{D}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nCalculate the function $f(x,y).$"
